avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-21T12:23:32-07:00","id":1540850,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dragox27</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1540775-curseborne-sorcerers-1-the-unburdened?p=1540803#post1540803\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What are these guys' Inheritances like? It's not mentioned in this one unlike the others.</div> </div> </div> </div>Based on the YouTube video for character creation of Sorcerers:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/0S46fewoKJs?si=wdrnaatrBz2h9Epn\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/0S46fewoKJs?si=wdrnaatrBz2h9Epn\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/0S46fewoKJs?si=wdrnaatrBz2h9Epn\" target=\"_blank\"> https://youtu.be/0S46fewoKJs?si=wdrnaatrBz2h9Epn </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> It's something like this (Subject to Change):<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Major Path (Inheritance) - Bleed 1 Curse Die if people notice you to make the witnesses describe you incorrectly. Clash if target is supernatural. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25291-donteatrawhagis","name":"DontEatRawHagis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"211"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-21T21:47:51-07:00","id":1540874,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I totally forgot to make that clear in this blog-post, but Knightingale has the right of it. <br /> <br /> They can seamlessly blend into their surroundings, making it hard for witnesses to remember their presence in a scene, even if they do something obvious.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Danielle Lauzon, Requiem Developer, Storypath Guru, freelance writer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6155-impernious","name":"impernious","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-22T22:10:30-07:00","id":1540928,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the confirmation. I don't suppose there is any word on what the Sorcerer Inheritance is, is there?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27505-dragox27","name":"Dragox27","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27505_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-26T10:23:59-07:00","id":1541025,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dragox27</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1540775-curseborne-sorcerers-1-the-unburdened?p=1540928#post1540928\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks for the confirmation. I don't suppose there is any word on what the Sorcerer Inheritance is, is there?</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, yeah. The Lineage Inheritance. Sorcerers take up a special interest. Whenever you take actions pertaining to your special interest, you get hits that apply before the roll based on your Entanglement.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Danielle Lauzon, Requiem Developer, Storypath Guru, freelance writer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6155-impernious","name":"impernious","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-28T23:04:24-07:00","id":1541171,"title":"","content":"Oooh, that's a fun one. Thanks for the answers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27505-dragox27","name":"Dragox27","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27505_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}